### Note on Bundled Art Assets (Non-Commercial)
This MIT License applies strictly to the **SOURCE CODE** of this project. It does NOT apply
to the bundled pixel-art assets under `src/renderer/src/assets/` (tilesets, maps, and character sheets),
which originate from LimeZu and are distributed under the **LimeZu FREE VERSION license — non-commercial use only**.
The recolored sprites derived from those sheets inherit the same non-commercial restriction.
See `src/renderer/src/assets/ATTRIBUTION.md` for details.
To use this project commercially, replace those assets or obtain a commercial license from the asset creator.
